footer: Enter:Detail  Y:Yank Cell  yy:Yank Row  K:Row Detail  dd:Stage Del  c:Connections  ?:Help  Esc:Back  q:Quit
help: Y: Copy the active cell value to clipboard
help: y, y: Copy the active row values to clipboard (TSV)
help: K: Open Row Detail
help: d, d: Stage the active row for deletion (red highlight; :w to commit)
help: c: Open Connection Selector
help: Esc: Exit cell selection and return to scroll mode without clearing staged deletes
