ConnectionSetupDropdownCancel: Esc, ^Esc, ⌥Esc, ^⌥Esc, ⇧Esc, ^⇧Esc
ConnectionSetupDropdownConfirm: Enter, ^Enter, ⌥Enter, ^⌥Enter, ⇧Enter, ^⇧Enter
ConnectionSetupDropdownNext: ^'n', Down, ^Down, ⌥Down, ^⌥Down, ⇧Down, ^⇧Down
ConnectionSetupDropdownPrev: ^'p', Up, ^Up, ⌥Up, ^⌥Up, ⇧Up, ^⇧Up
ConnectionSetupSave: ^'s'
