## SqlModal editing
SqlModalClear: ^'l', ^⌥'l', ^⇧'l'
SqlModalEnterNormal: Esc, ⇧Esc
SqlModalInsertTab: Tab, ^Tab, ⌥Tab, ^⌥Tab, ⇧Tab, ^⇧Tab
SqlModalNewLine: Enter, ^Enter, ⇧Enter, ^⇧Enter
SqlModalSubmit: ⌥Enter, ^⌥Enter, F(5)
